# GMGN Agent API credentials
# Real values go in ~/.config/gmgn/.env (chmod 600), NOT in the repo.
#
# Read-only access — required for all query skills (token, market, portfolio, track).
# Demo key for smoke tests only: gmgn_solbscbaseethmonadtron
GMGN_API_KEY=

# Request-signing key — required ONLY for trading skills (swap, cooking, strategy orders).
# This is the Ed25519 PEM whose public half you uploaded at https://gmgn.ai/ai.
# It is NOT a blockchain wallet key, but anyone holding it can trade as you.
# LEAVE EMPTY until guardrails are in place (see docs/DECISIONS.md, decision #3).
GMGN_PRIVATE_KEY=
